{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12814","headline":"送故人归鲁 · 韩翃","name":"送故人归鲁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲁客多归兴，居人怅别情。\n雨余衫袖冷，风急马蹄轻。\n秋草灵光殿，寒云曲阜城。\n知君拜亲後，少妇下机迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}